<title>THAILAND: Land and House Q3 net falls 15.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Land and House Q3 net falls 15.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the period ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     2.69     vs	     3.25</p>
<p>    Net			437.08     vs	   518.43</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     9.69     vs	     9.69</p>
<p>    Net		    1,569.22     vs	 1,505.50</p>
<p>NOTE - Land and House is a property developer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
